From ab98365740538dcef33ec9ff62bc2eae91bde8ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1vivy <1vivy@tutanota.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 22:24:48 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 19/19] camera: sepolicy: don't allow cameraserver to read
 vendor_default_prop

The earlier "quiet benign camera-stack avc denials" change granted
cameraserver a get_prop() on vendor_default_prop to silence permissive=0
avc spam seen during OplusCamera pipeline setup. cameraserver is a
coredomain, so an allow on vendor_default_prop:file violates the Treble
property-ownership neverallow (system/sepolicy/public/property.te:353 and
private/property.te:164), failing the sepolicy_neverallows and
system_ext_sepolicy.cil build steps.

The read is not functionally required (stock labels that property with a
typed context absent on this build; the camera pipeline works without it).
Silence the benign denial with dontaudit instead of granting a coredomain
access to a vendor property type, which keeps the log quiet without
tripping the neverallow.
---
 sepolicy/private/cameraserver.te | 9 +++++++--
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sepolicy/private/cameraserver.te b/sepolicy/private/cameraserver.te
index c221da5..77a0b53 100644
--- a/sepolicy/private/cameraserver.te
+++ b/sepolicy/private/cameraserver.te
@@ -5,5 +5,10 @@ allow cameraserver data_system_camera_rus:file { read getattr setattr open };
 allow cameraserver opluscamera_app:process setsched;
 
 # cameraserver reads OEM vendor_default_prop during OplusCamera pipeline setup
-# (benign getprop fallback; was permissive=0 avc spam).
-get_prop(cameraserver, vendor_default_prop)
+# (benign getprop fallback; was permissive=0 avc spam). cameraserver is a
+# coredomain, so an allow on vendor_default_prop:file trips the Treble property-
+# ownership neverallow (system/sepolicy/{public,private}/property.te). The read
+# is not functionally required (stock labels the prop with a typed context that
+# is absent on our build); silence the benign denial with dontaudit rather than
+# granting a coredomain access to a vendor property type.
+dontaudit cameraserver vendor_default_prop:file { read getattr map open };
